    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u200b\u200bGame genre:</strong> Visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u200b\u200bClear time\u200b:</strong> Approximately 55 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is fictional.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 They say stories are fundamental tools for understanding the world. Yet crafting a good story demands both skill and resources. Does this inevitably mean some people possess an inherent advantage\u2014or disadvantage\u2014in telling their tale?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 In the early 2020s, as the great tide of the era receded, grains of sand were settling into position. Yet young hearts forever yearn to charge forward\u2014even when the enemy remains unseen, or when only imagined foes can be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743910/extras/0febb092f1d58b367a1d1a809597109e.avif?t=1753836539\" data-has-big width=800 height=114 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u200b\u200bGame genre:</strong> Visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u200b\u200bClear time\u200b:</strong> Approximately 55 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is fictional.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 They say stories are fundamental tools for understanding the world. Yet crafting a good story demands both skill and resources. Does this inevitably mean some people possess an inherent advantage\u2014or disadvantage\u2014in telling their tale?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 In the early 2020s, as the great tide of the era receded, grains of sand were settling into position. Yet young hearts forever yearn to charge forward\u2014even when the enemy remains unseen, or when only imagined foes can be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743910/extras/0febb092f1d58b367a1d1a809597109e.avif?t=1753836539\" data-has-big width=800 height=114 /></span></p>",
